### ========================================
### TraktTV
### 注意: Trakt 必须提供 type 参数 (movies 或 shows)
### ========================================

### --- URL 方式 ---

### GET - Trakt 电影
GET {{baseUrl}}/api?url=https://trakt.tv/movies/independence-day-1996&key={{apiKey}}

<> response/2026-05-12T112204.200.json

### GET - Trakt 电视剧
GET {{baseUrl}}/api?url=https://trakt.tv/shows/breaking-bad&key={{apiKey}}

<> response/2026-05-12T112233.200.json

### --- Params 方式 ---

### GET - Trakt 电影
GET {{baseUrl}}/api?source=trakt&sid=independence-day-1996&type=movies&key={{apiKey}}

<> response/2026-05-12T121521.200.json

### GET - Trakt 电视剧
GET {{baseUrl}}/api?source=trakt&sid=breaking-bad&type=shows&key={{apiKey}}

<> response/2026-05-12T121555.200.json

### POST - Trakt 电视剧
POST {{baseUrl}}/api?key={{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "source": "trakt",
  "sid": "breaking-bad",
  "type": "shows"
}

<> response/2026-05-12T121623.200.json

### ========================================
### 搜索功能（智能选择平台）
### ========================================

### 自动搜索 - 中文关键词（自动使用豆瓣/TMDB）
GET {{baseUrl}}/api?query=流浪地球&key={{apiKey}}

<> response/2026-05-12T121655.200.json

### 自动搜索 - 英文关键词（自动使用 IMDb/TMDB）
GET {{baseUrl}}/api?query=Magic Mike&key={{apiKey}}

<> response/2026-05-12T130632.200.json

### POST - 自动搜索
POST {{baseUrl}}/api?key={{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "query": "流浪地球"
}

<> response/2026-05-12T122227.200.json

### ========================================
### 媒体 ID 桥接接口
### 路径: /api/media-id-bridge
### 注意: 保留 PT-Gen 的 API_KEY 鉴权
### ========================================

### GET - 通过 IMDb ID 查询
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/media-id-bridge?imdbid=tt0111161&key={{apiKey}}

<> response/2026-05-12T191657.200.json

### GET - 通过 Douban ID 查询
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/media-id-bridge?doubanid=1292052&key={{apiKey}}

<> response/2026-05-12T191749.200.json

### GET - 通过名称查询
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/media-id-bridge?name=消失的人&key={{apiKey}}

<> response/2026-05-12T192527.200.json

### GET - 通过名称 + 年份查询
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/media-id-bridge?name=消失的人&year=2005&key={{apiKey}}

<> response/2026-05-12T192606.200.json

### POST - 通过 IMDb ID 查询
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/media-id-bridge?key={{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "imdbid": "tt0111161"
}

<> response/2026-05-12T192636.200.json

### POST - 通过 Douban ID 查询
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/media-id-bridge?key={{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "doubanid": "1292052"
}

<> response/2026-05-12T192654.200.json

### POST - 通过名称查询
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/media-id-bridge?key={{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "name": "消失的人",
  "year": "2005"
}

<> response/2026-05-12T192709.200.json